{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"清水灣私家車失事翻側　司機受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-TKO-261030-13.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】清水灣有私家車失事翻側，司機受傷送院。</p><p>私家車撞毀路邊鐵欄，剷上山坡草叢，警員到場調查。</p><p>早上10時許，該私家車在沿大坳門路往將軍澳方向行駛，期間懷疑失事，撞向路邊鐵欄翻側。司機負傷自行離開車廂，由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:28.572957+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:25:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.400089+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:58.540655+00:00","content_hash":"35ea96c7a8b5022de35577d01169dcbcb607f920fb25fa7296066387ea906082","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:28.572957+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}